  "body": "# **brighter elytra**\n\n\n## example\n\n![before](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9315f2452ef9a0aede90ee0e2c13ed5d39b95710_0.webp)   ![after](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33d77f1e69af75d1b819e1b8fdac083b00316f8.png)\n\n### **what it does**\nVanilla turns the texture from a purple to a dull gray however, using this pack you can keep the nice purple as shown in this picture\n\n![what it looks like](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af86fba6aa6a35ada73461f8e35ffcd8e3a30c25_0.webp)\n\ni recommend using this pack together with others with this such as [bare bones](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/bare-bones) or [bliss](https://github.com/X0nk/Bliss-Shader)\n\nif you want to showcase this feel free\n\nalso try [my other packs](https://modrinth.com/user/simple-shea)",
